  "details": "Description\n\nIf I enter a \"Friends\" instance where a friend is present and then leave, it shows the friend as being in a \"Private World,\" even though they say they are still in that \"Friends\" instance. Also, clicking on the friend does not show the option to join them.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIf I enter a \"Friends\" instance where a friend is present and then leave, it shows the friend as being in a \"Private World,\" even though they say they are still in that \"Friends\" instance. Also, clicking on the friend does not show the option to join them.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 월드\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-18_19-21-58.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_55560c5a-4193-48b2-b130-c5b3f53c7f08/1/file)",
